msgstr "Invoer het misluk - kon nie ouerrekord skep nie"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Bad File Format - No Slow Query Log Entries Found"
msgstr "Slegte lêerformaat - geen stadige navraag-logboekinskrywings gevind nie"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The initial Slowlog has been ingested.  Post Processing will take place in the background.  You can start analyzing the Details once the status is complete"
msgstr "Die aanvanklike Slowlog is ingeneem. Naverwerking sal in die agtergrond plaasvind. Jy kan die besonderhede begin ontleed sodra die status voltooi is"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Post Processing Failed - Database Error"
msgstr "Naverwerking het misluk - databasisfout"

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (not unlimited) for this request - a large import could be killed mid-run. Some web servers/proxies (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) enforce their own independent cutoff that this setting cannot override."
msgstr "max_execution_time is %d sekondes (nie onbeperk nie) vir hierdie versoek - 'n groot invoer kan halfpad gestop word. Sommige webbedieners/instaanbedieners (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) dwing hul eie onafhanklike afsnytyd af wat hierdie instelling nie kan oorheers nie."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (not unlimited) for this request - a very large slow query log can exceed this while it is being read/imported."
msgstr "memory_limit is %s (nie onbeperk nie) vir hierdie versoek - 'n baie groot stadige navraag-logboek kan dit oorskry terwyl dit gelees/ingevoer word."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "post_max_size (%s) is smaller than upload_max_filesize (%s) - uploads up to the advertised limit will still be rejected."
msgstr "post_max_size (%s) is kleiner as upload_max_filesize (%s) - oplaaie tot by die geadverteerde perk sal steeds verwerp word."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "upload_max_filesize (%s) is small for a MySQL/MariaDB slow query log, which can easily be hundreds of MB."
msgstr "upload_max_filesize (%s) is klein vir 'n MySQL/MariaDB stadige navraag-logboek, wat maklik honderde MB groot kan wees."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The uploaded Slowlog file exceeds the server's maximum upload filesize."
msgstr "FOUT: Die opgelaaide Slowlog-lêer oorskry die bediener se maksimum oplaailêergrootte."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload was interrupted before it finished - please try again."
msgstr "FOUT: Die Slowlog-lêeroplaai is onderbreek voordat dit voltooi is - probeer asseblief weer."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server has no temporary folder configured to receive the uploaded Slowlog file."
msgstr "FOUT: Die bediener het geen tydelike gids opgestel om die opgelaaide Slowlog-lêer te ontvang nie."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server failed to write the uploaded Slowlog file to disk."
msgstr "FOUT: Die bediener kon nie die opgelaaide Slowlog-lêer na skyf skryf nie."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: A server extension blocked the Slowlog file upload."
msgstr "FOUT: 'n Bedieneruitbreiding het die Slowlog-lêeroplaai geblokkeer."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload failed (error code %d)."
msgstr "FOUT: Die Slowlog-lêeroplaai het misluk (foutkode %d)."

