msgstr "%d Karakters"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Slowlog Table Names [ optional ]"
msgstr "Slowlog-tabelname [ opsioneel ]"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Laat leeg vir outomatiese bespeuring wat baie vinniger werk."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Cacti-tabelbespeuring"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Hoe om Cacti-eie tabelle te onderskei van ander tabelle waarna in die stadige navraag-logboek verwys word. Verstek is om elke tabel sonder groepering te bespeur."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Bespeur alle tabelle (geen 'ANDER TABELLE'-groepering nie)"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Gebruik hierdie Cacti-databasis; groepeer ander tabelle as 'ANDER TABELLE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Bespeur alle tabelle; groepeer tabelle nie in die lys hieronder nie as 'ANDER TABELLE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Tabelle van belang"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Slegs gebruik deur die 'Bespeur alle tabelle; groepeer ... as ANDER TABELLE'-opsie hierbo. Verskaf asseblief 'n spasie-geskeide lys van bekende tabelle om mee te vergelyk. In Linux/UNIX kan jy 'n lys tabelle verkry met die volgende opdrag:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Die waardes van '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', en '<i><b>database</b></i>' word met jou eie waardes vervang."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Oplaaiperke"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Lêergrootte-oplaaiperke in Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Maks. oplaailêergrootte"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Die maksimum lêergrootte wat jou Apache-bediener toelaat om op te laai, is gestel op die waarde regs. Tans kan jy nie 'n lêer groter as dit oplaai nie. As jy MySQL stadige logboeke het wat groter is as dit, moet jy die <i>php.ini</i>-lêer wat met Apache geassosieer word wysig, die veranderlike <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> vind en die waarde verhoog. Daarna moet jy Apache herbegin."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Maks. POST-grootte"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Die maksimum grootte wat jy na die Apache-bediener kan pos, is gestel op die waarde regs. As jy MySQL stadige logboeke het wat groter is as hierdie waarde, moet jy die <i>php.ini</i>-lêer wat met Apache geassosieer word wysig, die veranderlike <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> vind en die waarde verhoog. Daarna moet jy Apache herbegin."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Maks. uitvoertyd"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Hoe lank (in sekondes) hierdie versoek toegelaat word om te loop; 0 beteken onbeperk. Hierdie inprop verhoog dit reeds na onbeperk vir sy eie versoeke, maar 'n webbediener of omgekeerde instaanbediener voor PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) kan steeds die versoek onafhanklik afsny - dit kan nie van hier af bespeur of oorheers word nie."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Onbeperk"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Geheueperk"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Hoeveel geheue hierdie versoek toegelaat word om te gebruik; -1 beteken onbeperk. Hierdie inprop verhoog dit reeds na onbeperk vir sy eie versoeke. 'n Baie groot stadige navraag-logboek wat in 'n enkele versoek gelees/ingevoer word, kan 'n beperkte waarde oorskry."

